    /* S_SD_FULL_ACCESS */ "Full SD card access",
    /* S_SD_FULL_ACCESS_CONFIRM */ "This lets the PC companion browse, add, rename and delete ANY file on your SD card over Wi-Fi and USB — not just the folders HaulNX manages. Turn it on?",
    /* S_STORAGE_TITLE */ "SD card",
